        }
      ],
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "decision-class",
          "nodeId": "decision"
        },
        "markdown": "Decision records a resolved choice and may supersede older decisions.\n\nAuthored fields: `label`, `rationale`, `status`, `decidedAt`, `owner`, `supersededBy`.\n\nThe detail surface represents the full editor contract; card and icon surfaces are deliberate projections.",
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "Decision records a resolved choice and may supersede older decisions.\n\nAuthored fields: `label`, `rationale`, `status`, `decidedAt`, `owner`, `supersededBy`.\n\nThe detail surface represents the full editor contract; card and icon surfaces are deliberate projections.\n\nStatus: `pending` is a question asked with nothing put forward yet. `proposed` is an answer put forward and waiting for the owner's yes: nothing proposed is in force. `decided` is approved and in force. `superseded` was decided once and has been replaced (see `supersededBy`)."
        },
        "renderShape": {
          "kind": "markdown"
        }
      }
    },
